{"3998620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Beetle Battle Bros", "steam_appid": 3998620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beetle Battle Bros </strong>is a 1v1 physics-based 3D fighter where you face off in chaotic beetle arena battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998620/extras/5c715c39b8952c34db0523f29893477d.poster.avif?t=1777341247\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998620/extras/5c715c39b8952c34db0523f29893477d.webm?t=1777341247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998620/extras/5c715c39b8952c34db0523f29893477d.mp4?t=1777341247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rule is simple:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push. Flip. Ram. <strong>Knock your opponent off the arena.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No complicated combos &amp; No memorized move lists</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just positioning, timing, leverage - and pure <strong>beetle instinct</strong>!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998620/extras/c4e5e8edd286ff5a23e7fca4961239bc.poster.avif?t=1777341247\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998620/extras/c4e5e8edd286ff5a23e7fca4961239bc.webm?t=1777341247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998620/extras/c4e5e8edd286ff5a23e7fca4961239bc.mp4?t=1777341247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🪲 <strong>Beetle Ball Mode</strong> ⚽</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What if <strong>Rocket League</strong>… but with beetles?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push a giant dung ball into your opponent’s goal in chaotic, physics-based soccer battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s loud, messy, and perfect for shouting at your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998620/extras/3b19d1b07a96e724e7b75f0e9103b120.poster.avif?t=1777341247\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998620/extras/3b19d1b07a96e724e7b75f0e9103b120.webm?t=1777341247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998620/extras/3b19d1b07a96e724e7b75f0e9103b120.mp4?t=1777341247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100% physics-driven combat with simple, easy-to-pick-up controls </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1v1 local &amp; online multiplayer built for rivalry</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A roster of unique beetles (yes, including Spider and Scorpion)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built on a custom 3D voxel engine</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A very serious ladybug referee! 🐞</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time to host your own <strong>Beetle Tournament</strong> - see you in the  arena!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beetle Battle Bros </strong>is a 1v1 physics-based 3D fighter where you face off in chaotic beetle arena battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"b